   229   1. The data blob should be accessed using bam_get_qname, bam_get_cigar,
   230      bam_get_seq, bam_get_qual and bam_get_aux macros.  These returns pointers
   231      to the start of each type of data.
   232   2. qname is terminated by one to four NULs, so that the following
   233      cigar data is 32-bit aligned; core.l_qname includes these trailing NULs,
   234      while core.l_extranul counts the excess NULs (so 0 <= l_extranul <= 3).
